    "body": "> But this particular test is against [HTMLOrSVGImageElement](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#htmlorsvgimageelement)'s third step:\r\n\r\nYou mean this test? \r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/fill-and-stroke-styles/2d.pattern.image.zerowidth.html#L23\r\n\r\nIt's checking that the result is null, not that an error is thrown. As I read https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-context-2d-createpattern it certainly looks like `null` is the expected result. We can't both return null and throw an error, right?",
