    "body": "Oh, of course 🤦‍♀️. I got confused by chromium code that was conflating the different sources for patterns. Thanks for your explanation.\r\n\r\nSo for [createPattern](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/canvas.html#dom-context-2d-createpattern), if the source is a zero width canvas element checking the useability will throw and we will not get a `null` for the pattern and that's fine?",
